{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I've confirmed the township is Gugulethu. The clues all match:\n- Established in the 1960s for migrant workers\n- Streets named with \"NY\" (Native Yard) prefix, renamed (NY1 → Steve Biko Drive, etc.)\n- 2022 article about unveiling a new emblem/logo (d27)\n- 2013 article about Mzoli's butchery-come-restaurant (d25)\n\nNow I need to find the early 2020s article about a school established in the 1980s that started in a church in Gugulethu, and the role of the longest-serving employee. Let me search for this.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Gugulethu school established 1980s started in church longest serving employee\", \"Gugulethu school 1980s church history article 2020 2021 2022\", \"school started in church Gugulethu 1980s longest serving staff member\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_988820cea20f4ce3be4fba74","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Gugulethu school founded 1980s church longest serving employee role\", \"Gugulethu school history started church 1980s article\"], \"top_k\": 6}","name":"search"},"id":"call_e7b2769853cd48af841d2c86","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789481337,"id":"chatcmpl-dcd9d505-5c39-9b6a-9c25-ed77a2a1d0bd","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":14586,"completion_tokens":265,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":14851,"cached_tokens":7168,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":7168},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}